OL,3,GNEWSATrail honours generations of
OL,4,Ashipyard workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoutes used by generations of workers
OL,7,Ftravelling to and from historic
OL,8,Fshipyards are being celebrated with a
OL,9,Fspecial trail.
OL,11,FThe new Shipyard Trail gives visitors
OL,12,Fthe chance to follow the routes between
OL,13,FBideford and Appledore yards in north
OL,14,FDevon and highlights more than 500
OL,15,Fyears of shipbuilding along the
OL,16,FTorridge estuary.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
